---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";

const pageTitle = "Privacy Policy | GB GROUP";
const pageDescription = "How GB GROUP handles information you share through this website and its enquiry forms.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <section class="section container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead muted">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>

    <div class="legal">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.brand} ("we", "us") operates this website. For questions about this policy or your
        information, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call
        <a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit an enquiry we collect the details you choose to provide:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and mobile number (required).</li>
        <li>Your email address, if you provide one.</li>
        <li>The service you select and the message you write.</li>
        <li>Your agreement to be contacted about that enquiry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How an enquiry is handled</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries are sent to our team using WhatsApp and/or email. If a secure lead endpoint has
        been configured for this deployment, the details are also delivered to that endpoint. We
        use the information only to respond to your enquiry and to provide the service you asked
        about. We do not sell your details.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not set advertising cookies. If Google Analytics has been configured for
        this deployment, it records anonymised usage events such as page views and contact-link
        clicks to help us understand which pages are useful. Otherwise, no analytics script loads.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        WhatsApp (Meta), your email client, Google Maps on the contact page, and Google Analytics
        where enabled are third-party services with their own privacy terms. Opening a WhatsApp or
        Maps link takes you to those services.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Retention and your choices</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to handle the request and for reasonable
        business records. You can ask us to access, correct or delete the details you shared by
        contacting us using the details in section 1.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Images on this website</h2>
      <p>
        Some photographs are illustrative and representative of the type of work described. They
        are not representations of specific GB GROUP projects, clients, employees or properties
        unless explicitly stated.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy when our processes change. The date above always shows the latest version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
